      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "An open trial was conducted of systemic griseofulvin in the treatment of oral lichen planus. Eleven patients completed the trial. Symptomatic benefit was noted in 21% of the twenty-three patients starting the trial, but there was no clinical improvement, and about one half of the group starting the trial suffered adverse drug reactions."},
